# Commented out due to SQLBuilder and AST validation failures (b/524454473):
# 1. SQLBuilder fails on the original AST because it does not support correlated
#    columns (the captured lambda argument 'y') in the GQL CALL parameter list
#    (ResolvedGraphCallScan::parameter_list).
# 2. The UDF lambda inliner fails to update the GQL CALL parameter list during
#    substitution, resulting in an invalid AST that fails post-rewrite validation
#    ("Column must come from the left scan").
# Since the test runner requires SQLBuilder to succeed even with
# allow_internal_error_todo_bug, this test must be commented out for now.
# # TODO: Support graph call parameter_list update in substitution
