# Transitive lambda inlining through a built-in higher-order function.
# Tests that when an outer UDF passes a lambda that references the outer UDF's
# function-typed parameter into another UDF (PropagateTransform) that delegates
# to a built-in function (array_transform), the function-typed parameter
# reference inside the lambda body is correctly inlined.
